<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LiveWorld: Simulating Out-of-Sight Dynamics in Generative Video World Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zicheng Duan<sup id="1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1∗</span></sup>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiatong Xia<sup id="2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1∗</span></sup>
</span></span>
